Name: guatiao
Version: 0.0.0-alpha.1
Date: 2026-10-22
Title: Values, Schemas and Plugin Libraries Across Languages
Author: jose-pr <jose-pr@coqui.dev>
Maintainer: jose-pr <jose-pr@coqui.dev>
Description: Bindings over the guatiao C ABI for GNU Octave and MATLAB:
 values shared with C, Rust, Python, Dart, Node, Go, Julia and R code
 without copying their shape, their JSON Schema descriptions, JSON, TOML
 and YAML text, forms, and a registry of plugin libraries whose providers a
 host calls through typed function tables. A provider can be written as a
 classdef. The guatiao library itself is not included: it is opened at run
 time from the path in GUATIAO_LIBRARY. Installing compiles one MEX file,
 which needs libffi.
License: MPL-2.0
Categories: Data, Interop
Url: https://github.com/Boriken-Dev/guatiao
SystemRequirements: libffi
